    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "How accurate is the neural scan?"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "It maps over 100,000 dermal points with 98% precision to ensure your ritual is perfectly synced with your current skin biology."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "Can I use my current products?"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "Yes. Sensoria analyzes your existing routine and suggests how to optimize it with AI-driven timing and specific application methods."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "Is it suitable for sensitive skin?"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "Absolutely. The system detects sensitivity markers and automatically prioritizes barrier repair and calming ingredients in your daily ritual."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "How often should I scan my skin?"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "We recommend a deep scan once a week. This allows the AI to track subtle changes and adjust your formula based on stress and climate."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "What if my local climate changes?"
    },
    {
      "file": "src/sections/faq/content.ts",
      "text": "The app automatically updates your routine in real-time based on local UV levels, humidity, and pollution markers in your area."
    },
